# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, regardless of platform or a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout (the common default: core.autocrlf=true)
# converts every LF-committed text file to CRLF on checkout. That does two
# things:
#   1. Every line of every text file shows as changed in `git diff`/`git status`
#      for no real reason, even when nothing was touched.
#   2. src/scripts/generate-sml-schema.ts's mermaid `classDiagram` detection in
#      resources/sml-reference/*.md expects LF and silently fails to find any
#      diagrams when the files are CRLF, which aborts `npm run build` before it
#      reaches the extension-manifest/bundle steps.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.pptx binary
